   "hash": "b5f5bcee",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/LUK.21.13#p1-b5f5bcee",
     "text": "While the valour of the martyrs and the savageness of the persecutors strove together, till both, exceeding nature and belief, bred wonder and astonishment in beholders and hearers.",
     "anchor": "And it shall turn to you, &c."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
